WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.835
Watch and read: For your reading practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:04.835 --> 00:00:09.470
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:09.779
character?

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:14.734
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.

